<html>
    <body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f4f4; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
        <table
            role="presentation"
            width="100%"
            cellpadding="0"
            cellspacing="0"
            style="background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 24px 0;"
        >
            <tr>
                <td align="center">
                    <table
                        role="presentation"
                        width="600"
                        cellpadding="0"
                        cellspacing="0"
                        style="background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;"
                    >
                        <!-- Header Section -->
                        <tr>
                            <td style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b1e3f 0%, #5c1029 100%); background-color: #8b1e3f; padding: 20px 32px;">
                                <span style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;">DBT Alliance</span>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        
                        <!-- Body Section -->
                        <tr>
                            <td style="padding: 32px;">
                                <div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 14px; max-width: 600px;">
                                    <p>Dear {Applicant_Full_Name},</p>
                                    
                                    <p>Thank you for submitting your application for <strong>{Scheme_Name}</strong>. This email confirms that your application has been received by the India Alliance.</p>
                                    
                                    <!-- Details Box -->
                                    <div style="background-color: #fce8e8; border-left: 4px solid #d32f2f; padding: 16px 20px; margin: 20px 0;">
                                        <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;"><strong>Applicant:</strong> {Applicant name}</p>
                                        <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;"><strong>Application ID:</strong> {Reference ID}</p>
                                        <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;"><strong>Grant Title:</strong> {Project Title}</p>
                                        <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>Date Submitted:</strong> {Submission date}</p>
                                    </div>
                                    
                                    <p>Please quote your Application ID in any future correspondence regarding this application. Your application will now go through the review process; we will contact you separately regarding the outcome of your application.</p>
                                    
                                    <p>If you have any questions, please contact us at <a href="mailto:grants@indiaalliance.org" style="color: #8b1e3f; font-weight: bold;">grants@indiaalliance.org</a>, quoting your Application ID.</p>
                                    
                                    <p style="margin-top: 30px;">Regards,<br>
                                    <strong>Grants Team</strong><br>
                                    India Alliance</p>
                                </div>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </body>
</html>